          "level": 2,
          "content": "7.2 Constructing a Triangle When its Sides are Given"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.808,
            0.702,
            0.828
          ],
          "content": "How do we construct triangles that are not equilateral?"
